              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious - there's nothing like oven roasted potatoes to compliment a grilled steak dinner! Who knew something could taste so good using only 1 Tbsp. of olive oil... The mix of fresh herbs was fabulous and the addition of the red pepper flakes gave it a nice \"kick\". This is a wonderful side dish!"
