            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Bippi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The red pepper flakes gave these potatoes a nice kick! I used baby red potatoes and slow cooked them at 325 degrees F: 45 minutes, stir, and an additional 20 minutes. They came out perfect.",
