              "name": "Dick Tebaldi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I roasted mine for 50 minutes @ 350º (to match my roasted pork temp.) and got nice and crusty potato cubes. I used smoked paprika for color and flavor. I tossed the cubes in olive oil, onion (chopped) rosemary and salt and pepper to taste. You can add grated parmesan when you take them out of the oven. Add chopped garlic at the end so it doesn't burn.",
